# Lauren mode discovery

Project Custom Mode paths:

- `/lauren-mode` → `.cursor/skills/lauren-mode/SKILL.md`
- `/lauren` → `.cursor/skills/lauren/SKILL.md` (mobile alias)

Marketplace pstack stays in `.cursor/settings.json`. Cursor does not load `.ai/plugins/`.

If those skill files are missing, do not conclude they were never added. This checkout is older than Dezocode/Sai#70 (`8a30202`) or a later discovery commit. Run `git fetch origin main` and `git ls-tree origin/main .cursor/skills`. Then check out a SHA that contains the files.

Slash is hyphenated (`/lauren-mode`) or the short alias (`/lauren`). `/lauren mode` with a space is `/lauren` plus argument `mode`.

Do not copy pstack into `.cursor/skills/` (decision 0004). Do not commit `.cursor/environment.json` (decision 0005).
